WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.442
Dad: Brenda's parents are going to pick you up at the bus station.

2
00:00:06.443 --> 00:00:12.181
Mom: Call us as soon as you arrive.

3
00:00:12.182 --> 00:00:15.381
Brian: Ready to go, Ricky?

4
00:00:15.382 --> 00:00:24.832
Ricky: Yeah, I've got everything.

5
00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:27.350
Brian: This is so exciting.

6
00:00:27.351 --> 00:00:36.544
Ricky: We get to take the bus by ourselves!

7
00:00:36.545 --> 00:00:42.407
Dad: Here are your tickets, boys.

8
00:00:42.408 --> 00:00:46.213
Mom: You have to change buses once.

9
00:00:46.214 --> 00:00:50.315
Ricky: Going to New Mont. No problem.

10
00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:53.843
Dad: It's Newman.

11
00:00:53.844 --> 00:00:56.481
Ricky: Newman. Got it.

12
00:00:56.482 --> 00:00:59.503
Mom: Call us as soon as you arrive.

13
00:00:59.504 --> 00:01:07.767
Ricky: Don't worry. Everything will be fine.

14
00:01:07.768 --> 00:01:14.591
Dad: The bus driver will help you too.

15
00:01:14.592 --> 00:01:21.053
Ricky: Bye! I'll call you!

16
00:01:21.054 --> 00:01:30.506
Brian: Our adventure begins!

